        <h3>Journal Publishing</h3>
        <p>End-to-end peer-reviewed journal publishing with editorial management and global visibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-mini-card gs-reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="mini-icon" style="color: var(--gold); background: rgba(251,191,36,0.1);"><i
            class="fa-solid fa-book"></i></div>
        <h3>Book Publishing</h3>
        <p>Academic and research book publishing with ISBN registration and distribution support.</p>
